Q: Print both the key and the value for a specific key-value pair A: <pre class="lang-console prettyprint-override"><code>$ jq '{k1}'
{
  &quot;k1&quot;: &quot;v1&quot;
}

$ jq -c '[to_entries[0][]]'
[&quot;k1&quot;,&quot;v1&quot;]

$ jq -c 'to_entries|map([.key,.value])'
[[&quot;k1&quot;,&quot;v1&quot;],[&quot;k2&quot;,&quot;v2&quot;]]
</code></pre>
